  "title": "True Pilgrim Stuffing",
  "description": "Simple and tasty, this is an old family recipe for stuffing that can be baked in a Dutch oven or stuffed into a turkey. This recipe uses only a few ingredients - ground beef, sausage, celery, onion, butter, and bread cubes.",
  "authors": [
    "MICHELLEP426"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T02:47:03-04:00",
